# Admin password reset on a disposable mechanic (registered and deleted here): body validation, target rules, the forced
# password change gate and its release. An admin target other than the caller needs a second admin, so it is not covered.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@TestPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@TemporaryPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_NEW_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@ResetMechanicEmail = password.reset.{{RunId}}@example.test
@UnknownMechanicId = 999999

### [Setup][Reset] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Reset] Login as admin (200 expected)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-autoservice_csrf='))?.match(/^__Host-autoservice_csrf=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Reset] Register the disposable mechanic that gets reset (200 expected)
# @name resetMechanic
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Password", "lastName": "Reset", "email": "{{ResetMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][Reset] Blank temporary password is rejected (400 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{resetMechanic.personId}}/password-reset
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "temporaryPassword": "   " }

?? status == 400

###

### [Negative][Reset] Temporary password that breaks the Identity password policy is rejected (400 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{resetMechanic.personId}}/password-reset
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "temporaryPassword": "123" }

?? status == 400

###

### [Negative][Reset] Resetting the caller's own password is forbidden (403 expected, the caller is also the only admin)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{adminLogin.personId}}/password-reset
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "temporaryPassword": "{{TemporaryPassword}}" }

?? status == 403

###

### [Negative][Reset] Unknown mechanic id (404 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{UnknownMechanicId}}/password-reset
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "temporaryPassword": "{{TemporaryPassword}}" }

?? status == 404

###

### [Positive][Reset] Admin resets the mechanic's password (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{resetMechanic.personId}}/password-reset
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "temporaryPassword": "{{TemporaryPassword}}" }

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.email == {{ResetMechanicEmail}}
?? js (typeof response.parsedBody.emailSent == "boolean") == true

###

### [Negative][Reset] The previous password no longer logs in (401 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{ResetMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}" }

?? status == 401

###

### [Positive][Reset] Login with the temporary password succeeds and reports the forced change (200 expected)
# @name flaggedLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{ResetMechanicEmail}}", "password": "{{TemporaryPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-autoservice_csrf='))?.match(/^__Host-autoservice_csrf=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.mustChangePassword == true

###

### [Negative][Reset] Every other route is gated until the password changes (403 expected, code password_change_required)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers

?? status == 403
?? js response.parsedBody.code == password_change_required

###

### [Positive][Reset] The session check stays reachable and reports the flag (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.mustChangePassword == true

###

### [Positive][Reset] Changing the temporary password releases the gate (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/change-password
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{TemporaryPassword}}", "newPassword": "{{TestPassword}}", "confirmNewPassword": "{{TestPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-autoservice_csrf='))?.match(/^__Host-autoservice_csrf=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Reset] Routes work again after the change (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Reset] The session check reports the flag cleared (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.mustChangePassword == false

###

### [Setup][Reset] Logout the mechanic (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Cleanup][Reset] Login as admin again to delete the disposable mechanic (200 expected)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-autoservice_csrf='))?.match(/^__Host-autoservice_csrf=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Cleanup][Reset] Delete the disposable mechanic (200 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{resetMechanic.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200
